# appsettings.json and appsettings.Development.json are gitignored developer files holding real
# credentials — an SMTP app password, OAuth client secrets, an embeddings API key, a JWT signing key.
# `COPY . .` would bake them into the published image, where anyone who can pull from ECR can read
# them. The image ships appsettings.Production.json (non-secret operational defaults) and takes every
# credential from the environment instead.
appsettings.json
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.*.Local.json

bin/
obj/
test-results/
TestResults/
*.user
.vs/
